        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ZUMANU Trip&quot; is a simple exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the city of ZUMANU, enjoy the scenery and discover crystals and mandarin oranges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have collected all the crystals, a magic circle will be activated, and when you step on it, the area will change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore by walking, running, jumping, and flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump up to three times, allowing you to reach higher places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can reset your jump count by touching a wall while jumping, allowing you to reach even higher places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are in the air, you can fly on a broom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you ride a broom, you fall very slowly, allowing you to stay in the air for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is useful for traveling to other locations or looking down on the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clear story in &quot;ZUMANU Trip.&quot; Feel free to explore.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;ZUMANU Trip&quot; is a simple exploration game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore the city of ZUMANU, enjoy the scenery and discover crystals and mandarin oranges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have collected all the crystals, a magic circle will be activated, and when you step on it, the area will change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can explore by walking, running, jumping, and flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump up to three times, allowing you to reach higher places. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can reset your jump count by touching a wall while jumping, allowing you to reach even higher places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are in the air, you can fly on a broom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you ride a broom, you fall very slowly, allowing you to stay in the air for a long time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is useful for traveling to other locations or looking down on the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no clear story in &quot;ZUMANU Trip.&quot; Feel free to explore.</p>",
